                <pb facs="0114" n="104" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg104"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/6–2548: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Tientsin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Smyth</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-07-01T15:00:00-04:00">July 1, 1948—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>145. View expressed Nanking’s tel. 118 to Tientsin repeated Dept at 1145, June 25
                    concurred in by Dept. (Sent Tientsin as 145, repeated Nanking as 966.)</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
